{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOL","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約珥書","commonName":"約珥書","title":"約珥書","order":29,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"b7dcc5db4dcd3ce09a891b7715e7031d7b27bfe3dc62d09644d1c538a20dd57e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":73},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝要審判萬國"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「到那日，我要使猶大和耶路撒冷被擄的人返鄉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那時，我要聚集萬國，帶他們下到約沙法",{"noteId":2},"谷，在那裡審判他們，因為他們把我的子民，就是我的產業以色列，分散到各國，並瓜分我的土地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他們抽籤分了我的子民，將男童換妓女，賣女童買酒喝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["「泰爾、西頓和非利士境內所有的人啊，你們為什麼這樣對我？你們要報復我嗎？如果你們是報復我，我必速速使你們遭報應。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你們奪去我的金銀，搶走我的珍寶，拿去放在你們的廟中，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["並把猶大和耶路撒冷的居民賣給希臘人，使他們遠離家鄉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["然而，他們被賣到哪裡，我要促使他們從哪裡離開，並要使你們得到報應，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我必把你們的兒女賣給猶大人，猶大人必把他們賣給遠方的示巴人。這是耶和華說的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"你們去向列國宣告：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「要召集勇士，徵調軍隊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"前去打仗！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要將犁頭打成刀劍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把鐮刀鑄成矛頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弱者要說自己是勇士！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四圍的列國啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們快快聚集到那裡吧！」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你差遣大能的勇士降臨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「列國都要起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上到約沙法谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我要坐在那裡審判周邊列國。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"開鐮吧，因為莊稼熟了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踩踏吧，因為榨酒池的葡萄滿了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"酒池滿溢，因為他們惡貫滿盈。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"千千萬萬的人聚集在審判谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的日子要臨到那裡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日月昏暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"星辰無光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華從錫安發出怒吼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從耶路撒冷發出雷聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天地為之震動。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和華卻是祂子民的避難所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列人的堡壘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"「這樣，你們就知道我是你們的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我住在我的聖山錫安。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷必為聖城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外族人必不再侵犯它。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"「到那日，群山要滴下甜酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"丘陵要流出乳汁。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大的溪澗碧水常流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有清泉從耶和華的殿中流出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"澆灌什亭谷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及必一片荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以東必成為荒涼的曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們曾殘暴地對待猶大人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在猶大濫殺無辜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但猶大必常有人住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷必存到萬代。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必追討","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"尚未追討的血債，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華住在錫安。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"「約沙法」意思是「耶和華審判」。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":2}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"「追討」希伯來文是「洗淨」。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":21}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}